# Sidequest: Raise a Chocobo's "if you control four or more Birds" is checked as the ability triggers and again as it resolves
# (CR 603.4). Bot1 controls four Birds on turn 3 (the token, Birds of Paradise, Aven Skirmisher and Aven Envoy), so it triggers at
# the beginning of the first main phase. In response Bot1 taps Birds of Paradise for {R} and casts the Lightning Bolt it drew on
# the Aven Skirmisher: the Bolt resolves first, the Birds are three and the ability does nothing - no transform, no land fetched,
# no search prompt.

